03C/svg>\u003C/strong>\u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-screen-18\">立体色域至大提升\u003Csup>11\u003C/sup>\u003C/p>\u003C/li>\n        \u003Cli class=\"umx-li3\">\u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-screen-19\">41.6%\n          \u003Csvg class=\"umx-arrow-svg\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"29\" viewbox=\"0 0 17 29\" fill=\"none\">\n           \u003Cpath d=\"M16.1719 8.08594V12.0634L9.49219 5.38376V28.1802H6.67969V5.38376L0 12.0634V8.08594L8.08594 0L16.1719 8.08594Z\" fill=\"#F0B419\" />\n          \u003C/svg>\u003C/strong>\u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-screen-20\">动态对比度提升\u003Csup>11\u003C/sup>\u003C/p>\u003C/li>\n       \u003C/ul>\n      \u003C/div>\n     \u003C/div>\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-stage iqooz11turbo-eye umx-dark-mode\">\n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-section umx-section1\" data-track=\"{'type':'viewstate','params':{'cfrom':'00003','pagecode':'003','product':'iQOO Z11Turbo','block':'15','total':'31'}}\">\n      \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-title umx-data-speed\">\n       \u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-1\" class=\"umx-main-title\">旗舰同款悦目护眼\u003Csup>12\u003C/sup>\u003C/p>\n       \u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-2\" class=\"umx-intro\">从硬件调光到软件算法，时刻守护你的用眼健康\u003Csup>*\u003C/sup>。\u003C/p>\n      \u003C/div>\n     \u003C/div>\n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure-box umx-data-speed\">\n      \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-f1 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/figure>\n      \u003Cul class=\"umx-data-items\">\n       \u003Cli class=\"umx-li1\">\u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-3\">多种调光选择\u003C/strong> \u003Cstrong class=\"umx-21\" uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-4\">类 DC 调光｜至高 4320Hz 超高频调光｜全亮度类 DC 调光\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n       \u003Cli class=\"umx-li4\">\n        \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-icon lazy-imageom\">\u003C/figure>\u003Cp class=\"umx-18\" uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-5\">SGS 硬件级低蓝光认证\u003C/p>\u003C/li>\n       \u003Cli class=\"umx-li5\">\u003Cp class=\"umx-18\" uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-6\">晕动视觉辅助｜AI 舒眠模式｜干眼友好色温区间｜1 nit 睡眠屏\u003C/p>\u003C/li>\n       \u003Cli class=\"umx-li6\">\u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-7\">游戏护眼 2.0\u003Csup>12\u003C/sup>\u003C/strong>\u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-8\" class=\"umx-18\">动态侦测游戏画面，智能调节蓝光量与亮度，既护眼\u003Cbr class=\"umx-mb-hide\">又不偏色，缓解长时间对战后的眼疲劳。\u003C/p>\u003C/li>\n       \u003Cli class=\"umx-li7\">\u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-9\" class=\"umx-28\">竞技模式\u003C/strong>\u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-10\">智能调整蓝光分量和屏幕亮度，专注对战更沉浸。\u003C/p>\u003C/li>\n       \u003Cli class=\"umx-li9\">\u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-13\" class=\"umx-28\">舒缓模式\u003C/strong>\u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-14\">恒定柔和色温，长时间游戏更舒适。\u003C/p>\u003C/li>\n      \u003C/ul>\n      \u003Cp class=\"umx-p-tips\" uimix-text=\"iqooz11turbo-eye-17\">*本产品非医疗器械，不具有疾病治疗功能。护眼是指通过多维度技术以实现缓解眼部疲劳、降低眼部不适感。\u003C/p>\n     \u003C/div>\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-stage iqooz11turbo-touch umx-dark-mode\">\n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-section umx-s1\" data-track=\"{'type':'viewstate','params':{'cfrom':'00003','pagecode':'003','product':'iQOO Z11Turbo','block':'16','total':'31'}}\">\n      \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-title umx-data-speed\">\n       \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y300proplus-touch-0\" class=\"umx-vice-title\">全新一代超感触控\u003C/p>\n       \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y300proplus-touch-1\" class=\"umx-main-title\">芯片 + 算法双重加持\u003Cbr>制胜快人一步\u003C/p>\n       \u003Cp uimix-text=\"y300proplus-touch-2\" class=\"umx-intro\">超感触控芯片加持，赛场级触控，至快点击、滑动响应速度，指尖闪电，同时点击快人一步，多指操控随手急停。\u003C/p>\n       \u003Cul class=\"umx-data-items umx-data-items1\">\n        \u003Cli class=\"umx-li1\">\u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"y300proplus-touch-3\">25.35ms\u003C/strong>\u003Cp uimix-text=\"y300proplus-touch-4\">\u003Cspan class=\"umx-ml\">《\u003C/span>王者荣耀》 平均点击触控时延\u003Csup>13\u003C/sup>\u003C/p>\u003C/li>\n       \u003C/ul>\n      \u003C/div>\n     \u003C/div>\n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure-box umx-data-speed\">\n      \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-f1 lazy-imageom\">